Description: GtkImage: add the use-fallback property
Origin: debian/patches/093_gtk3_gtkimage_fallbacks_use.patch, refreshed for gtk2-ng

--- a/gtk/gtkimage.c
+++ b/gtk/gtkimage.c
@@ -138,6 +138,7 @@
 
